   "lines": [
    "Breakfasted with",
    "West; poor old Doc[?]",
    "is awfully cut up",
    "about Cornel's[?] insane",
    "marriage. Spent the",
    "morning with",
    "darling little",
    "Aunt Annie,",
    "lunched with",
    "West and Alfred",
    "and came out",
    "to Oyster Bay in",
    "afternoon. It is",
    "just lovely to be",
    "back with the",
    "family again.",
    "All look beautifully",
    "except dear old Nell"
   ],
